# Terror of Mount Velus: "When this creature enters, creatures you control gain double strike until end of turn" (CR 611.2c, 702.4).
# On turn 3 Bot1 has a Memnite out and casts Terror with two Black Lotuses and a Mox Ruby: the trigger gives double strike to the
# Memnite and to Terror itself, not to Bot2's Memnite (it is not Bot1's), and not to a second Memnite Bot1 casts afterwards (it
# was not there as the ability resolved). On Bot1's next turn the Memnite has lost it, and Terror keeps its own printed double
# strike.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Mox Ruby
Memnite x2
Terror of Mount Velus
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mountain x19

